  "how_to_recheck": "The URL above is the version-history page, not the workbook. GET it and take the HIGHEST v<major>.<minor> across every link matching Annex[-_]3[-_].*(elec|electricity).*\\.xlsx; the series is published under several stems (Network-cost-allowance-methodology-elec, network-cost-allowance-methodology-electricity, Annex_3_-_...). If the highest is above `version_token`, the loss multipliers here were read from a superseded workbook. A later edition adds columns and can restate the historical ones.",
